mplate_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le16ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Ok. Peter spit it out. You were giving me the cold shoulder all through lunch and all the way home. What's eating you? Is it the trip?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, it's the trip. You might have given me a heads up before lunch today.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: I'm sorry about that. Unfortunately, I didn't really know for sure until today. Candace is as secretive as she is intelligent.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: But you had an idea?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well, Candace and I may have had some correspondence about it back and forth, but nothing was made official until today.", "time": " 100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What about your clients?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Some of them I will reschedule, the others I will refer to another person in the office.\nYou are more upset than I expected about this.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm angry actually. You could have informed me a little earlier so we could have had a discussion about this.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>:  What is to discuss?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Us! Our relationship. Sometimes I feel I am more serious about this relationship than you are.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Peter. We've been dating for a month. You have known about my volunteering since we started going out. This is something that I do. This may be less lucrative than my other job, but rest assured it is much more rewarding and important.", "time": "33000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I may have known about your volunteering, but I just wish I could have been a part of your decision to go to Africa.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>:   I'm sorry Peter, but at this time, you don't get to be a part of my decision process as it pertains to my life, and if you think you do, then maybe you are not as thoughtful as I thought you were.\n<span class=\"strong\"></br>Peter</span>: Thoughtful as going off to Africa without talking it over with your boyfriend?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>:  I'm going to go now. I'll call you tomorrow and we'll talk again. Ok?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok.", "time": "73000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "type": "sena"}